   "idea": "Replace the naive *next\u2011fit* packing with a **first\u2011fit decreasing (FFD)** heuristic that sorts items once before processing, then packs each item into the first existing bin that still has enough free space; this alone typically reduces the number of bins by ~10\u201320 % while staying far under the 2 s limit."
